{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-10",
  "title": "一段长梦将醒",
  "storyCode": "15-11",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a47400147e321fa76fdbbb4ab6057633a567e5bc4c3113c9b3c13450bf8dc6a1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "弗里斯顿不明白为什么女儿要约自己在这里见面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里可不算度假的好去处，鞋里太容易进沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，歇一歇吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他坐在沙丘上，脱下皮鞋。而倾倒下来的沙尘却随风扑向了他的脸，弄得他很狼狈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳，咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这也太不体面了——礼服？我为什么要穿全套的礼服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她为什么约我来这？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "通讯没有任何回应，他只能在黄沙中茫然地踱步，他呼唤着女儿的名字。\n无人回应他，直到夜色来临。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......派对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他循着声音找了过去，看到了远处沙丘上张灯结彩的营地。\n他听到了女儿熟悉的笑声，他欣喜若狂地狂奔而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“女儿”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还是赶来了我的婚礼，爸爸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那头金发让弗里斯顿几乎要哭出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我找了你很久，我的晨光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是你的婚礼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“女儿”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，典礼快开始了，我们过去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“女儿”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们会挽着手走过红毯。祝福我吧，爸爸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "弗里斯顿想要牵住她的手，可总也够不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“女儿”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你不想祝福我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......不......不是这样......我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）......我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你不想祝福我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）......我的晨光？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也并不期许我们看到那片真实的星空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）......你不是我的晨光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）我已经离开了家？这个地下掩体，我记得——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）“保存间”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你不再回应我的请教了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）克丽斯腾。你是克丽斯腾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）我听说过你，不不，我见过你......不对，我是从哪知道了你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）我从没认识过你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）哪个混蛋关上了我的灯？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（未知语言）该死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗里斯顿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么要把我关在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这又是某种无聊的恶作剧吗？可露希尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "弗里斯顿发现自己被满房间的“照片”完全淹没了，而一本《泰拉全物种详考》的书册正盖在他的镜头模组上。\n或许也算不上照片......他从未去过照片中的任何地方，也无法去到照片里的任何地方。\n大量的照片上只印刷着零碎的影像。\n沙丘、篝火、营地、金色的头发，还有那间暗无天日的保存间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......梦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "弗里斯顿做了一个梦。Friston-3做了一个梦。\n而他更是打印了自己的梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不该有做梦的功能才对，是可露希尔偷偷上传了新的固件吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弗里斯顿先生，我现在没有时间和你争论！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以非常明确地向你保证，我绝对绝对没有给你上传任何能让你做梦的固件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "PRTS的异常越来越严重，备用指挥系统上线也还需要时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......还得手动分配工作项，我现在眼睛已经快盯不过来了！而且某些区域已经完全失去了联系，情况完全不明——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放轻松，可露希尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我并不是想要和你争论，只不过是在尝试排除引发我身体出现罕见故障的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们既然已经排除了固件报错和硬件故障的可能性，那——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可露希尔，回答我一个很重要的问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "驱动我核心运转的能源是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，当然是源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们的改型作业平台几乎都是源石驱动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......弗里斯顿先生，你的语气很可怕。你想说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可露希尔，你是一个天才。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能想到提前切断所有改型作业平台与PRTS的连接，但恐怕这远远不够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？怎么了？为什么突然开始颠簸了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡是被不断闪烁的亮光弄醒的。她看向舷窗外，却并没有发现任何异样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......今天的天气很好，好像没有要下雨的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，是其他人在外面训练弄出来的动静吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦......PRTS的通讯还是没有恢复吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，今天好像是去舰外隔离带出外勤的日子，先去找梓兰姐姐报道吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈切~大家，都去哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好安静呀......梓兰姐姐现在在哪呢？唔，联系不上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先去食堂看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "食堂、食堂是在这边——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "睡眼蒙眬的泡普卡闭着眼睛也知道从甲板走到食堂的路线。\n她太熟悉罗德岛了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，欸，啊啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好痛......泡普卡，好痛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她发现自己被随意扔在走廊上的工程部箱子绊倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像......工程部最近确实在做很多改造，不过这片区域好像早就结束了呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼，太粗心啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她蹲下揉了揉已经不怎么有痛感的膝盖，然后顺手将散落在地上的工具和箱子收到了走廊的边上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，又是那个光......到底......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她站起身，下意识地看向了一旁的舷窗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡看到了许多奇怪模样的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们，是谁......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是新来的客人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泡普卡记得，舷窗的那一边好像是甲板，她们是迷路了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她快速地在走廊中前进，但越走却越疑惑，于是她渐渐慢了下来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么，每一扇舷窗上都能看到她们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
